  <Index>k__BackingField: 13
  <Title>k__BackingField: Dust Devil
  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: The Shadow's raiders have dug in on the Ares Flats. Fly low over the desert, break their outposts and convoys, and stop the Sand Crawler before it reaches the colony.
  introduces: 'Planet strike: the ground scrolls under you. Air and ground targets, money for every kill.'
  hints:
  - The machine gun hits both air and ground. Ground units are flown over, aircraft can be rammed.
  - 'Shoot the crawler''s turrets first: its cannon is armoured until they fall.'
